  "text": "Track 12.11"
 },
 {
  "id": 2,
  "start": 4.259,
  "end": 5.203,
  "text": "PART 1"
 },
 {
  "id": 3,
  "start": 6.604,
  "end": 7.112,
  "text": "But I’m afraid"
 },
 {
  "id": 4,
  "start": 7.137,
  "end": 9.382,
  "text": "Nissan is actually Korean."
 },
 {
  "id": 5,
  "start": 10.219,
  "end": 10.584,
  "text": "Er …"
 },
 {
  "id": 6,
  "start": 11.195,
  "end": 12.1,
  "text": "I don’t think so …"
 },
 {
  "id": 7,
  "start": 12.372,
  "end": 13.571,
  "text": "I’m pretty sure it’s Japanese."
 },
 {
  "id": 8,
  "start": 13.596,
  "end": 14.42,
  "text": "I’m sorry,"
 },
 {
  "id": 9,
  "start": 14.508,
  "end": 15.778,
  "text": "but it’s definitely Korean."
 },
 {
  "id": 10,
  "start": 16.36,
  "end": 17.916,
  "text": "I remember reading an article about the"
 },
 {
  "id": 11,
  "start": 17.941,
  "end": 19.496,
  "text": "factories in South Korea."
 },
 {
  "id": 12,
  "start": 20.294,
  "end": 20.588,
  "text": "Well,"
 },
 {
  "id": 13,
  "start": 20.882,
  "end": 22.882,
  "text": "maybe Nissan have factories in Korea,"
 },
 {
  "id": 14,
  "start": 22.937,
  "end": 25.241,
  "text": "but that doesn’t mean it’s a Korean company."
 },
 {
  "id": 15,
  "start": 25.981,
  "end": 26.672,
  "text": "I think they just make"
 },
 {
  "id": 16,
  "start": 26.697,
  "end": 27.6,
  "text": "some of them in Korea."
 },
 {
  "id": 17,
  "start": 29.152,
  "end": 30.501,
  "text": "Maybe you’re thinking of Toyota?"
 },
 {
  "id": 18,
  "start": 31.131,
  "end": 32.297,
  "text": "That’s a Japanese company."
 },
 {
  "id": 19,
  "start": 32.647,
  "end": 33.194,
  "text": "That’s right."
 },
 {
  "id": 20,
  "start": 33.371,
  "end": 34.509,
  "text": "Toyota is the biggest"
 },
 {
  "id": 21,
  "start": 34.534,
  "end": 35.553,
  "text": "Japanese car company."
 },
 {
  "id": 22,
  "start": 35.578,
  "end": 36.261,
  "text": "Exactly."
 },
 {
  "id": 23,
  "start": 36.54,
  "end": 38.651,
  "text": "Yes, but, the second biggest is Nissan,"
 },
 {
  "id": 24,
  "start": 38.892,
  "end": 40.209,
  "text": "then Honda, probably."
 },
 {
  "id": 25,
  "start": 40.735,
  "end": 41.854,
  "text": "Or maybe Suzuki."
 },
 {
  "id": 26,
  "start": 41.975,
  "end": 45.142,
  "text": "Oh, I’m sorry but firstly,"
 },
 {
  "id": 27,
  "start": 45.573,
  "end": 48.359,
  "text": "Nissan isn’t a Japanese company, like I said."
 },
 {
  "id": 28,
  "start": 48.727,
  "end": 49.204,
  "text": "And then,"
 },
 {
  "id": 29,
  "start": 49.856,
  "end": 52.205,
  "text": "Mazda is a much bigger company than"
 },
 {
  "id": 30,
  "start": 52.23,
  "end": 53.515,
  "text": "Suzuki or Honda."
 },
 {
  "id": 31,
  "start": 54.298,
  "end": 55.33,
  "text": "I’m not sure about that."
 },
 {
  "id": 32,
  "start": 55.999,
  "end": 57.697,
  "text": "I think they’re all a very similar size."
 },
 {
  "id": 33,
  "start": 58.358,
  "end": 59.683,
  "text": "And Nissan is Japanese."
 },
 {
  "id": 34,
  "start": 60.296,
  "end": 61.796,
  "text": "No, I really think …"
 },
 {
  "id": 35,
  "start": 61.892,
  "end": 62.789,
  "text": "Oh, never mind."
 },
 {
  "id": 36,
  "start": 63.379,
  "end": 64.212,
  "text": "It’s not important."
 },
 {
  "id": 37,
  "start": 67.854,
  "end": 69.322,
  "text": "Maybe you’re thinking of Mitsubishi?"
 },
 {
  "id": 38,
  "start": 70.175,
  "end": 71.548,
  "text": "They’re a big Japanese company."
 },
 {
  "id": 39,
  "start": 72.01,
  "end": 72.447,
  "text": "No,"
 },
 {
  "id": 40,
  "start": 72.621,
  "end": 73.51,
  "text": "I have a Nissan."
 },
 {
  "id": 41,
  "start": 73.782,
  "end": 74.964,
  "text": "That’s what I’m talking about."
 },
 {
  "id": 42,
  "start": 81.369,
  "end": 82.147,
  "text": "In Korea,"
 },
 {
  "id": 43,
  "start": 83.107,
  "end": 84.282,
  "text": "there’s Kia,"
 },
 {
  "id": 44,
  "start": 84.357,
  "end": 86.008,
  "text": "and I’m sure Nissan …"
 }
]